            <h2 class="section-title">Refund Procedure (8 Sequential Steps)</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">The IT exporter refund pipeline runs through 8 sequential steps. Each step is anchored to a specific section, rule, or notification - allowing IT finance teams to audit each handoff with documentary clarity.</p>
