            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-content">
                    <span class="step-badge">Step 8</span>
                    <h3 class="step-title">RFD-06 Final Sanction and Bank Credit</h3>
                    <p class="step-description">RFD-06 final sanction within 60 days of RFD-02 under Section 54(7). RFD-05 payment advice issued. PFMS Stage 2 validation. Bank credit confirmation typically Day 1 to Day 5 after RFD-05. Where final sanction crosses Day 60, Section 56 mandatory interest at 6 percent per annum auto-accrues. (Day 33 to Day 92.)</p>
                    <div class="step-highlights">
                        <span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>RFD-06 within Section 54(7) 60d</span>
                <span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>RFD-05 + PFMS Stage 2 + bank credit</span>
                <span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Section 56 interest auto</span>
                
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step-visual">
                    <div class="step-illustration">
                        <div class="illustration-icon">
